# class Slot { static visit(arg, role, type, width, func) { return func(arg, role, type, width); } }  class Temp { static visit(arg, role, type, width, func) { return func(arg, width, type, role); } }  function pass(thing, arg, role, type, width, func) { return thing.visit(arg, role, type, width, func); }
# A call by value passes the fifth argument in memory. Two methods of the program have the name and five parameters: the callee that is found is told apart, and what is neither is called as written.
